# React Frontend Rules

## Project Structure
```
src/
  ├── components/         # Reusable components
  ├── pages/             # Page components
  ├── hooks/             # Custom hooks
  ├── services/          # API services
  ├── utils/             # Helper functions
  ├── context/           # React context
  ├── styles/            # Global styles
  └── types/             # TypeScript types
```

## Component Guidelines
- Use functional components with hooks
- Implement proper prop types
- Keep components focused and reusable
- Follow container/presentation pattern

## State Management
- Use React Context for global state
- Implement Redux for complex state
- Keep state close to where it's used
- Use proper state initialization

## Styling
- Use Tailwind CSS for styling
- Follow mobile-first approach
- Maintain consistent color scheme
- Use CSS modules for components

## Forms
- Implement form validation
- Use controlled components
- Handle loading states
- Show clear error messages

## Navigation
- Use React Router
- Implement protected routes
- Handle 404 pages
- Maintain breadcrumbs

## Data Fetching
- Use React Query for API calls
- Implement proper error handling
- Show loading states
- Cache responses appropriately

## Performance
- Lazy load components
- Optimize images
- Minimize bundle size
- Use proper memoization

## Testing
- Write unit tests
- Implement integration tests
- Use React Testing Library
- Maintain good test coverage

## Accessibility
- Follow WCAG guidelines
- Use semantic HTML
- Implement keyboard navigation
- Add proper ARIA labels

## Error Handling
- Implement error boundaries
- Show user-friendly errors
- Log errors properly
- Handle offline states

## Code Style
- Use ESLint
- Follow Prettier config
- Maintain consistent naming
- Write clear comments

## Security
- Sanitize user input
- Prevent XSS attacks
- Handle sensitive data
- Implement CSP

## Features
### Dashboard
- Show property overview
- Display eviction statistics
- List recent activities
- Show important alerts

### Property Management
- List all properties
- Add/edit properties
- Show property details
- Track maintenance

### Tenant Management
- List all tenants
- Add/edit tenants
- Show payment history
- Track communications

### Eviction Cases
- List all cases
- Create new cases
- Track case progress
- Generate reports

### Reports
- Generate PDF reports
- Export data to CSV
- Show data visualizations
- Filter and sort data 